    (cavitySpinObservable Φ hΦ site) hNpos hC B₀ hB₀ a ha rfl b hb hblim hnull
  dsimp only at hh
  intro ε hε
  filter_upwards [hh ε hε] with j hj
  filter_upwards [hj] with n hn'
